From: nim-gtk2 native ownership audit
Subject: [PATCH] text attributes: free destination tabs and paragraph color on copy

GTK2.24.33 gtk_text_attributes_copy_values frees destination font/stipple resources
but overwrites its tabs/pg_bg_color without freeing them. Release those owned
resources after the existing self-copy/realized checks and before assignment.

Optional GTK SOURCE patch only, audited/dry-run against 2.24.33. Not installed or
validated as a rebuilt GTK binary by the SDK. No runtime workaround is provided.

--- a/gtk/gtktexttag.c
+++ b/gtk/gtktexttag.c
@@ -2050,6 +2050,12 @@
   if (dest->font)
     pango_font_description_free (dest->font);
   
+  if (dest->tabs)
+    pango_tab_array_free (dest->tabs);
+
+  if (dest->pg_bg_color)
+    gdk_color_free (dest->pg_bg_color);
+
   /* Copy */
   orig_refcount = dest->refcount;
 
